# Discord Server

@left

- I created a Discord Server called Neil Voss Lab.
  - Available as a mobile app, desktop app, and website.
  - Connect to my server rather than creating your own.
- Join the server: {{course_url:discord}}
- Post general course questions in the class channel; send private matters by direct message.

