=== layout: two-panels

# Ways to Contact Dr. Voss

@left

- [*Office hours*]{color=green}
  - Attend to ask in person or over Zoom.
- [*Discord*]{color=red}
  - By far the quickest; I check multiple times per day.
  - Send me a direct message (DM) or post to the whole class.
  - Response time: 1-2 calendar days.
@right

- [*Email*]{color=blue}
  - [_nvoss@roosevelt.edu_](mailto:nvoss@roosevelt.edu)
  - About 20 emails daily; I check once daily for mental health.
  - Response time: 2 business days.
- [*Anonymous Google Form*]{color=purple}
  - Goes to my email, but I can only read it on my laptop.
  - Response time: 2-4 business days.

